  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that rna_only models with scvi_n200 and multiprofile settings achieve higher accuracy (0.65) than multimodal baselines. This experiment tests whether combining scvi_n200 with a stronger image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) and weighted fusion (vs concat in config_030) can improve performance, isolating the impact of image modality and fusion strategy. It balances exploration of multimodal potential with the strong evidence for scvi_n200."
